  "stageId": "a001_05",
  "title": "Different Opinions",
  "storyCode": "GT-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "295a532ce767965c9f5d3282a38ae75f7779391bf5a96e85a9a9620f0ef631bd",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "So, this really is the only entrance to the cave, huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "Mhm. It's like a maze inside the cave, but the village elders have brought me here several times before, including when I succeeded the previous chief...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "...Um, I might just be imagining things, but don't you think the shouts from inside the forest are getting louder...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Things are only going to get worse if we run into any more delays.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Carol, you know your way around inside the cave, right? I'd like you to go inside and retrieve the treasure right now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "Huh? What about you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "I'll stay at the entrance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "No way!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Huh? Carol...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "You're going to face the bounty hunters alone? That's too dangerous! You'll be...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "If I can't help you secure that treasure, I'd be letting down the entire village, and you as well.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "...But, I don't want to lose you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "This... isn't the time or place for you to be playing hero...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "What's wrong with playing the hero?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "'Even with their hearts impaled by the enemy's blades, the King's knights still held on to their spears.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "I refuse to run away.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "Grani...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Besides, Carol, this isn't just my battle.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "It's also your battle. Perhaps you will run into dangers along the way, but as long as we can restore peace to this land...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "We must face our duties head-on.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "I trust that you'll find the treasure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "But... if I'm alone...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "The treasure...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Trust me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "No matter what, I'll protect you. Back when I rescued you, I promised that nobody would ever hurt you again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Not even a single strand of hair on your head.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "Even though you're just a kid...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "I'm no such thing... I'm just vertically challenged!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "Haha!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "...Mm, I'll do as you said, Grani.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "text": "Those damn whitemasks... Why do they always show up at the worst times?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Worthless scum, all of you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "You don't even have the right to challenge us for the treasure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "text": "Haaah? What are you talking about? This has long been our turn, so you'd better get lost, or else!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "(From this angle, I can see the fighting... It seems that the bounty hunters have gotten into a brawl with Reunion.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "(No matter who approaches this cave, I'll make sure I...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "text": "Let's make a run for the cave while those imbeciles duke it out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "text": "Wait, what's that kid doing there?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "You shall not pass.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "text": "Gwaah...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "text": "You, it's you—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "Out of my way, all of you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "I'm not in the mood to play around.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
